codex
The modular change removed the consecutive-label shortcut, but `easy` and `medium` are still solved 3/3, apparently by exact retrieval across the listed blocks. The Track B mechanical cost is still only thousands of membership tests, so the ladder is doing what it should: increasing the same-certificate haystack until direct textual scanning stops being viable.
