-emitter can resample duplicates, while larger `n` supplies an unbounded family.
-No SAT, ILP, or spectral method is relevant to this direct witness objective;
-the exact incidence scan is the stronger applicable standard method. Most
-importantly, no vendor-hardness claim should be trusted until the 403 blocker is
-removed and all three arms are rerun successfully.
