The final matching run again solved 9/9 and recorded `too_easy`. The rejected prototype is now preserved under `rejected_gen_2601_04295.py`; its local report passes all construction and verification gates with an exact solution density of `1/2,427,264`, while `REJECTED.md` separately records the decisive hardness failure. I’m doing a final consistency check of the module, report, transcript schema, and rejection rationale.
