- Track A fails because Sections 2–3 provide an explicit linear-time construction and witness algorithm, with no hard regime.
- The strongest Track B prototype passed all local gates, but the mandatory oracle loop solved 9/9 instances—3/3 at every preset—yielding `too_easy`.
